   {
    "id": 206842,
    "username": "ExpertGem",
    "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forum.pretendo.network/expertgem/{size}/59819_2.png",
    "created_at": "2026-07-30T01:00:17.024Z",
    "cooked": "<h3><a name=\"p-206842-we-are-aware-of-an-issue-in-monster-hunter-4g-and-monster-hunter-4-ultimate-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-206842-we-are-aware-of-an-issue-in-monster-hunter-4g-and-monster-hunter-4-ultimate-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>We are aware of an issue in Monster Hunter 4G and Monster Hunter 4 Ultimate.</h3>\n<p>Currently, there are various anomalies with regards to the Gathering Hall feature of the game. Players may experience connection issues when attempting to connect to a room, or may join the wrong room.</p>\n<p><strong>While we cannot provide an estimated time of arrival for a fix</strong>, please know that our developers have been made aware of the issue.</p>\n<p><em><strong>NOTE</strong></em>: Users have also reported issues with Monster Hunter Generations; please let us know if you are experiencing similar issues with this Service.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>If you’d like to track the issue on our GitHub page, please visit <a href=\"https://github.com/PretendoNetwork/monster-hunter-4-ultimate/issues/3\" class=\"inline-onebox\">[Bug]: Various issues while searching for gathering halls · Issue #3 · PretendoNetwork/monster-hunter-4-ultimate · GitHub</a>.</p>",
